    "terrainName": "berlin",
    "description": "What: on berlin a STOCHASTIC 'Blue Stochastic Platoon' (30 men in 3 squads from the TKB composite, defending at (300,300)) and a PHYSICAL 'Red Patrol' (four men) marching from 700 m north to 200 m. Judge: (1) while the patrol is beyond the resolution manager's band (400 m + 200 m lead) the platoon stays stochastic; (2) when the patrol enters it, the platoon de-aggregates as a PROCESS - Planning, Materialising, one-tick handover - and is Physical; (3) it splits ONE level (X-5, D-P7): into its 3 SQUADS, each a stochastic unit carrying its 10 slots, named <platoon>/<s> with the stable key uuid5(<platoon>, child:<s>), standing where the platoon stood, and the platoon's roster is the 3 squads; (4) the patrol being inside their band too, each squad then splits into its 10 men, named <platoon>/<s>/<n> with the key uuid5(<squad>, child:<n>); (5) with the patrol parked 200 m off the platoon never merges back (the merge line is 800 m). Fail: a split before the band, the platoon splitting straight into 30 men, a missing or re-keyed child, or a merge in contact. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh agg-split-on-contact"
  },
